    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "May antagonize phenytoin:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " seizure-controlled patients may need a higher phenytoin dose. MTX, anticonvulsants, alcohol, pyrimethamine and nitrofurantoin can cause folate deficiency."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
